{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8eef86e2-7d40-45ee-b652-7c2f5840ccb9",
    "name": "📌 Tencent Hy API (TokenHub)",
    "description": "### About Tencent Cloud TokenHub\n\n\"Tencent is a leading influencer in industries such as social media, mobile payments, online video, games, music, and more.\"\n\nTencent Cloud builds its own Hy models and, through TokenHub, also hosts models from other labs such as DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, MiMo, MiniMax and StepFun. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Cloud platforms**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Tencent Cloud TokenHub Account: [https://www.tencentcloud.com/](https://www.tencentcloud.com/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `tencent_tokenhub_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:tencent_tokenhub_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://intl.cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1300/78941](https://intl.cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1300/78941)\n    \n- Models: [https://intl.cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1300/80632](https://intl.cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1300/80632)\n    \n\n### Notes\n\nBase URL is the Singapore (Global) site. Use `https://tokenhub-us.tencentcloudmaas.com/v1` (Silicon Valley) or `https://tokenhub.tencentcloudmaas.com/v1` (Chinese mainland) as needed.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-11T21:25:36.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T23:54:06.000Z",
    "lastUpdatedBy": "7643177",
    "uid": "7643177-8eef86e2-7d40-45ee-b652-7c2f5840ccb9"
  },
